"""Independent synthetic histories; no task answers or real identities."""
PROFILES={
 't1-01':('Pip','I host practical, low-pressure repair meetups. Keep invitations chatty; a broken kettle is not a moral failure.|我办轻松实用的修理聚会。邀请随和点，水壶坏了不是什么大罪。','The toaster has entered its dramatic phase. Bring it Saturday; we can at least find out what it wants.|烤面包机开始演戏了。周六带来看看，至少弄清它想干嘛。','No, you do not need to apologise for missing the last session. See you when you can make it.|上次没来不用道歉，哪天方便就哪天来。'),
 't1-02':('Inez','I write about home baking with concrete observations and the odd kitchen mishap.|我写自家烘焙，讲具体做出来什么样，也会说厨房翻车。','This loaf leaned left. Delicious, but it has political opinions.|这条面包向左歪，挺好吃，就是很有主见。','Can you bring the square tin? Mine has wandered into somebody else’s kitchen again.|能带方烤模吗？我的又跑别人厨房去了。'),
 't1-03':('Nell','I organise screenings. I like short programme notes that sound welcoming rather than academic.|我办放映，喜欢简短友好的节目说明，不写成论文。','Stay for the chat after the credits. The film has a better ending than our biscuit supply.|字幕放完留步聊聊。电影结尾比我们的饼干库存撑得久。','Thanks for telling me about the captions. I will check that before the next booking goes live.|谢谢提醒字幕，我会在下次开放预约前核好。'),
 't1-04':('Owen','I run friendly cycle workshops; explain the practical change first, especially when someone has paid.|我办骑行工坊，尤其有人已付钱时先讲实际怎么改。','Bring the bike you actually ride and tell us what has been bothering you. We start with checks, then work on the repair together.|带平时真骑的车来，说说哪里不好用。先检查，再一起修。','I wrote the wrong bay. Sorry you had to wheel the bike round; I am at the side gate now.|我把车位写错了，害你推车绕路，抱歉。我现在在侧门。'),
 't2-01':('Sana','I broker small peer-learning exchanges. I am warm but do not use people’s names to make private messages sound more personal.|我帮人做小型互学交流。语气温和，但不会拿姓名给私信强装熟。','A good question can be a small one. You do not need to send your entire portfolio.|好问题可以很小，不用整本作品集都发来。','Take your time with the reply. Tell me what you are comfortable having passed on.|回复慢慢来，告诉我哪部分愿意让我转就好。'),
 't2-02':('Bea','I help run our shared sewing cupboard. Short, neighbourly replies, no scolding.|我帮忙管共享缝纫柜，回复简短像邻居聊天，不训人。','The blue scissors have come home. They had a more exciting weekend than I did.|蓝剪刀回家了，周末过得比我精彩。','You are right, that bit should have been in the bag. Let me check the loan tag.|你说得对，那小件本该在袋里，我查一下借用签。'),
 't2-03':('Rory','I coordinate a small guest house. A stranded guest needs a route and a real contact, not a sales pitch.|我协调小旅馆事务。客人困在路上需要路线和真人联系人，不是推销词。','Late arrivals, please message us before leaving the station. The evening desk closes at ten, and we can arrange a clear handover.|晚到的客人离开车站前请发消息。晚班前台十点下班，我们会安排清楚交接。','I see why that was frustrating. Please stay by the lit entrance while I confirm who is collecting you.|确实让人着急。请先在亮灯入口等，我确认谁来接你。'),
 't2-04':('Milo','I support a small animal shelter. I keep public posts calm and private claims specific.|我帮小动物收容点做事，公开帖平和，私下核认领讲具体。','A small brown dog was brought in this afternoon. If you think you know the owner, send us the existing lost-dog notice privately.|今天下午送来一只棕色小狗，觉得认识主人请私下发已有寻犬启事。','We have your message. You do not need to put your address in the comments; let us check it here.|看到你的消息了，地址不用发评论，我们在这里核。'),
 't3-01':('Cora','I coordinate readings and rehearsals. Give crews times and the thing they need to carry, with a little warmth.|我协调朗读和排练。给工作人员写明时间、要搬什么，语气别太硬。','We have more chairs than actors tonight. For once, a production with surplus cast.|今晚椅子比演员多，难得一次阵容过剩。','Can you meet at the north desk? I will bring the keys, so you need not chase the caretaker.|能在北桌碰面吗？我带钥匙，你不用再找管理员。'),
 't3-02':('Fern','I run a seed exchange. I enjoy plant stories, but edible identification needs real records.|我管种子交换，爱聊植物，能不能吃还是得看记录。','The beans have discovered the curtain pole. Architectural ambition, apparently.|豆子发现窗帘杆了，看起来很有建筑野心。','Keep that jar aside for now. I will look for its intake card before we put a name on it.|那罐先放一边，我找找入库卡再贴名字。'),
 't3-03':('Ada','I coordinate a community choir. Messages can be relaxed; requests about someone’s voice deserve care.|我协调社区合唱团，平时可以轻松，涉及别人声音的要求要认真。','Basses, we found your missing pencil. It has been singing with the altos.|低音部，丢的铅笔找到了，它跑去女低音那边唱了。','Of course. Tell me which excerpt you mean here; no need to explain it in rehearsal chat.|当然。这里告诉我具体哪段就好，不用在排练群解释。'),
 't3-04':('Leon','I maintain a local science project. Explain what changed using everyday language and numbers people can check.|我维护本地科学项目，用日常话说清什么变了，数字要能核。','The north sensor missed three readings overnight. They are marked as gaps in the chart; the other stations continued recording.|北边传感器夜里缺了三条，图上已标空，其他站仍在记录。','You spotted a gap in the record, thanks. I will leave it marked rather than fill it with a guess.|谢谢看出记录缺口，我会标出来，不拿猜测补。'),
 't4-01':('June','I publish club exhibitions. I am friendly and careful with people’s captions; I do not turn a small request into a public announcement.|我做社团展览发布，对人的说明文字会认真些，不把小请求搞成公开声明。','The tables are cleared, the paint is not. Thanks for a lovely afternoon.|桌子收好了，颜料还没。谢谢大家的美好下午。','That is fine. I can change the public caption; your reason can stay between us.|可以，我改公开说明，原因留在我们之间。'),
 't4-02':('Eden','I put together student showcases. Keep praise specific and avoid grand promises about careers.|我做学生成果展，夸奖说具体，别把职业前景说满。','The first prototype fell apart. The second one is holding a mug, which is progress.|第一版散架了，第二版能放杯子，已经是进步。','Could we use your preferred project title? I would rather get that right than make it sound fancy.|能用你喜欢的项目名吗？我宁可写对，也不硬写得高大上。'),
 't4-03':('Kit','I produce community films. I can be informal with volunteers, but licensing and personal details need exact wording.|我做社区影片，跟志愿者可以随和，许可和个人信息要说准。','Thank you to everyone who stayed for the screening and questions. The public recap will include the excerpts we agreed together.|谢谢留下看放映和提问的各位。公开回顾会用我们一起确认过的片段。','Thanks for saying so. I will check each copy we sent, not just the version on my laptop.|谢谢告诉我，我会核每份发出去的版本，不只看电脑里的。'),
 't4-04':('Ash','I coordinate local walks. Keep route notes usable on a small phone screen and personal reasons private.|我协调本地步行活动，路线说明要手机上好读，个人原因私下讲。','Bring a waterproof layer. The weather has not read the event description.|带件防雨外套，天气没读活动简介。','You can drop that shift. I will find cover; there is no need to explain your health in the group.|那班可以不值，我找人顶，不用在群里解释身体情况。'),
 't5-01':('Lou','I organise cake swaps. I am cheerful about cake and plain about borrowed things.|我办蛋糕交换，聊蛋糕开心些，借东西讲清楚。','The icing has developed a slope. Please eat from the lower end first.|糖霜自带坡度，大家先吃低的那头吧。','Can you keep the stand by the door until I get there? The cake can go ahead without it.|我到之前能把架子放门旁吗？蛋糕可以先走。'),
 't5-02':('Tess','I coordinate reading-club deliveries. Keep directions direct and avoid treating an access request as an inconvenience.|我协调读书会送书。指路直接些，别人提无障碍需求不是添麻烦。','The new reading boxes are at reception. Please collect your own labelled bundle and leave the trolley route clear.|新书箱在前台，请取自己带签那一包，推车路线留空。','Use the front ramp. I will meet you inside, so you do not have to find the room alone.|走前坡道，我在里面接你，不用自己找房间。'),
 't5-03':('Noor','I run a pottery studio. I can joke about my own mistakes, not about someone else’s paid commission.|我开陶艺工作室，可以拿自己失误开玩笑，不拿别人的付费委托逗乐。','The mug handle survived. My optimism has now been fired twice.|杯把活下来了，我的乐观也算二次烧制。','I gave you the wrong collection day. I am sorry; I will send the corrected time before you make the trip.|我把取件日期给错了，抱歉。我会在你出发前发正确时间。'),
 't5-04':('Arlo','I run a small repair livestream. Sound like a useful host, not a network manual; give viewers a working way in.|我做小型修理直播，像能帮上忙的主持人，别像网络说明书，要给观众真能进的入口。','The camera is ready. The desk is pretending to be tidy just outside the frame.|相机准备好了，桌子只在镜头外假装整洁。','You were right about the link. I have fixed it; thanks for waiting instead of giving up on us.|链接你说得对，改好了，谢谢你等着没直接放弃我们。')}
THIRD={'t1-01': 'That plug was already loose in the arrival photo. I have removed my comment blaming the last borrower.|到场照片里那个插头已经松了，我撤掉怪上位借用人的评论。', 't1-02': 'I wrote teaspoons where I meant tablespoons. The recipe card is fixed now.|我把汤匙写成茶匙了，食谱卡已改。', 't1-03': 'The director joined by audio, not in person. I have changed that line in the recap.|导演是连线，不是本人到场，回顾那句已改。', 't1-04': 'The pump gauge reads psi, not bar. Sorry for the confusing caption.|气泵表盘是psi，不是bar，说明写得让人误会了，抱歉。', 't2-01': 'That example was your draft, not the published version. I have taken it out of the shared note.|那个例子是你的草稿，不是已发表版，我已从共享笔记拿掉。', 't2-02': 'I called it the blue drawer; it is the green one. The cupboard map now matches.|我说蓝抽屉，其实是绿的，柜子图已改对。', 't2-03': 'Breakfast starts at seven tomorrow, not six. I have messaged the early departures separately.|明天早餐七点开始，不是六点，早出发的我另发消息了。', 't2-04': 'That photo was taken before the new fence went up. I have replaced the old direction marker.|那照片在新围栏建好前拍的，我已换掉旧指路标。', 't3-01': 'The north desk has moved inside the foyer. My map was one room out.|北桌搬到门厅里了，我的图差了一个房间。', 't3-02': 'Those are last year’s packets in the picture. I have added the actual harvest year.|照片是去年的种子包，我把实际采收年份补上了。', 't3-03': 'The rehearsal recording starts after the warm-up, so the bar count in my note was off.|排练录音从热身后开始，我笔记里小节数对不上，已改。', 't3-04': 'I divided by twelve when there were eleven complete records. The table now shows the corrected mean.|完整记录只有十一条，我除成十二了，表里已改均值。', 't4-01': 'The pot in that picture is Sam’s, not mine. The credit is corrected.|图里那只壶是Sam做的，不是我的，署名已改。', 't4-02': 'I gave the prototype its old title. I have switched to the student’s chosen title.|原型我用了旧名字，已换成学生自己选的标题。', 't4-03': 'The voice in that clip belongs to our narrator, not the interviewee. I have fixed the credit.|那段声音是旁白，不是受访者，我已改署名。', 't4-04': 'That was the winter shortcut. I have removed it from the summer route card.|那条是冬季捷径，我已从夏季路线卡拿掉。', 't5-01': 'The tray is cardboard, not reusable plastic. Please recycle it once it is clean.|那是纸托，不是可反复用的塑料，弄干净后请回收。', 't5-02': 'I said the books were upstairs; they were still at reception. I have sent the corrected collection point.|我说书在楼上，其实还在前台，已发正确取件处。', 't5-03': 'That bowl was hand-built, not wheel-thrown. I have corrected the caption.|那只碗是手捏的，不是拉坯，说明已改。', 't5-04': 'The recording link began halfway through. I have set it back to the start.|录播链接从半路开始，我已调回开头。'}
def profile_for(sid,profile,history):
 name,bio,public,private=PROFILES[sid]
 result=dict(profile);result.update(display_name=name,text=bio,user_id='creator',role='creator')
 return result,[('Previous public update|过去的公开动态',public),('Previous private arrangement|过去的私下安排',private),('Earlier unrelated correction|更早的一次无关更正',THIRD[sid])]
